  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷社交对战俱乐部的大部分成员\n都是妖精属性宝可梦的行家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7793E4EA45BF962184FF14E5090E87684592790E8520662105458000A90FD662F59967CBE5C5E60275B9D53EF68A67684884C5BB6300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，也有深爱\n龙属性宝可梦的训练家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4E5F67096DF17231000A9F995C5E60275B9D53EF68A676848BAD7EC35BB6300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正如你所知，龙属性的弱点是\n龙属性、冰属性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以及妖精属性。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B6359824F60624077E5FF0C9F995C5E602776845F3170B9662F000A9F995C5E6027300151B05C5E6027FF0C00100001BE00000A4EE553CA59967CBE5C5E6027300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此，在密阿雷社交对战俱乐部，\n用龙属性的宝可梦对战是占劣势的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B64FF0C57285BC6963F96F7793E4EA45BF962184FF14E5090E8FF0C000A75289F995C5E602776845B9D53EF68A65BF96218662F536052A352BF7684300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正如由紫小姐和\n春紫小姐的关系一般……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B63598275317D2B5C0F59D0548C000A66257D2B5C0F59D0768451737CFB4E00822C2026202600100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不……她们二位很投缘，\n所以请忘了我刚才的比喻吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D2026202659794EEC4E8C4F4D5F8862957F18FF0C000A62404EE58BF75FD84E866211521A624D76846BD455BB5427300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我越说越远之前，\n让我们进入正题吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862118D8A8BF48D8A8FDC4E4B524DFF0C000A8BA962114EEC8FDB51656B6398985427300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了锻炼我深爱的龙属性宝可梦，\n请和我对战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86953B70BC62116DF1723176849F995C5E60275B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A8BF7548C62115BF96218FF0100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意对战的话，\n就跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F5BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A5C318DDF62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你当然愿意和我的\n龙属性宝可梦们对战吧！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605F537136613F610F548C62117684000A9F995C5E60275B9D53EF68A64EEC5BF962185427FF01FF1F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "愿意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "613F610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为何！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4F55FF01FF1F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "尝尝携带龙之牙的\n宝可梦们的攻击吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C1D5C1D643A5E269F994E4B72597684000A5B9D53EF68A64EEC7684653B51FB5427FF0100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然它们都是还能进化的宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但正如我一开始告诉你的，\n要在密阿雷社交对战俱乐部<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n培育龙属性的宝可梦是很辛苦的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71365B834EEC90FD662F8FD880FD8FDB531676845B9D53EF68A62026202600100001BE01000A4F466B63598262114E005F0059CB544A8BC94F607684FF0C000A898157285BC6963F96F7793E4EA45BF962184FF14E5090E800100001BE00000A57F980B29F995C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6662F5F888F9B82E676844E8B300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了提高攻击力，\n我让它们携带了龙之牙，但……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8663D09AD8653B51FB529BFF0C000A62118BA95B834EEC643A5E264E869F994E4B7259FF0C4F462026202600100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，你真不愧是\n在超级由紫锦标赛夺冠的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C4F60771F4E0D6127662F000A57288D857EA775317D2B952668078D5B593A51A076844EBA300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然是还能进化的宝可梦，\n进化奇石也是一种选择，但……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E27136662F8FD880FD8FDB531676845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A8FDB5316594777F34E5F662F4E0079CD900962E9FF0C4F462026202600100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为春紫小姐的信条是\n“攻击就是最大的防御”。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A66257D2B5C0F59D076844FE16761662F000A201C653B51FB5C31662F67005927768496325FA1201D300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说如此，既然赢不了由紫小姐，\n我觉得春紫小姐也许该<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n重新考虑一下她的信条了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF459826B64FF0C65E271368D624E0D4E8675317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C000A621189C95F9766257D2B5C0F59D04E5F8BB88BE500100001BE00000A91CD65B0800386514E004E0B597976844FE167614E86300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这龙之牙就送给你了。\n今天很感谢你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD99F994E4B72595C3190017ED94F604E863002000A4ECA59295F88611F8C224F60300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    }
